detail.desc:
几百个小时了，你还在为了高难度只能玩轮椅苦恼吗？
Vanilla Perk Pro 把七套原版天赋从底层重做，九张牌全部自动激活，不用花天赋点。每套都是一整条机制链，而不是两张能用的卡加七张凑数。

Ever feel using the same old meta for hundreds or thousands of hours repetitive, but other perks either works a bit of a stretch on DS or straight up suck arse?
introducing Vanilla Perk Pro™, granting 7 perk decks from base game original (probably-I guess-cant really garanteen on that) and thoughtful new effect or a complete rework.

Changes include:

浪人：继承原版基本机制，将原版的10%常驻闪避改为奔跑时增加。闪避成功以最大生命上限百分比恢复血量，连续闪避时恢复增加。当你的血量低于25%时，你将强制变为100%闪避，直到你的血量高于25%。冷却时间200秒，每一次闪避减少10秒冷却时间
Rogue: 
-10% chance to dodge, +10% chance to dodge while sprinting; 
Gain health for dodging, chain dodging increases the health you gain; 
When your health gets below 25% your chance to dodge become 100%. This effect is reset once your health gets above 25%, and cannot occur more than once every 200 seconds, but each time you dodge will shorten the cooldown time by 10 seconds.

安娜奇：护甲机制完全保留。现在无敌不需要完全等待15秒，你可以通过击杀减少1.75秒冷却时间，但代价是基础冷却时间增加至20秒。当你的无敌触发时，你的护甲立刻回复至100%（受到来自自己的伤害，如自己的爆炸或燃烧不会触发回复护甲）
Anarchist: 
The cooldown for "immune to health damage" effect is extended to 20 seconds, but now will replenish your armor. Each enemy you kill will now reduce the cooldown timer by 1.75 seconds.

领队：在原版基础上增加小弟分担伤害机制。当你拥有小弟时，你收到的伤害的35%将由小弟承担，你自己承担65%。为了平衡，虽然你的小弟只为你减少35%伤害，但他们任然会受到65%伤害，此伤害无视减伤。现在，当你有激励战吼技能时，对友方单位呼喊将会使你和你呼喊的对象，都立刻回复10%血量，并在一段时间内回复20%的血量。并在10秒内武器换弹速度，移动速度增加35%。
Crew Chief:
While having a converted enemy, your damage taken is reduced by 35%. The remaining damage will be applied directly to you and your converted enemy; 
Inspire basic gain additional effect: Shouting at your teammates will greant both of you 10% health, 20% health over 20 seconds, and increase movement and reload speed by 35% for 10 seconds _(yes, both **YOU** and the teammate you are shouting at. For the teammate the 35% movement n reload speed buff is multiply upon the base 20%)_.

杀手：几乎完全重制，当你身穿西装或轻型防弹背心时，你受到的护甲伤害永远不会超过50%或33%，护甲受到伤害时无敌0.5秒，来自狙击手的伤害除外。你的护甲在完全破损前，只能通过击杀5名敌人来回复，护甲完全破坏后将在2秒后立刻回满，护甲恢复时无敌1秒。当你使用双持武器在一个弹匣内击杀10名敌人后，你将获得额外增益，增加你的双持武器换弹速度和弹药拾取量（其余武器只获得一半的加成），增益期间爆头击杀敌人有50%的概率立刻回复护甲。10秒内不击杀敌人增益消失，并进入20秒冷却。
Hitman (rework):
While wearing Suit/LBV, you'll never lose more than 50%/33% of armor per damage taken; 
When taking armor damage, immune to damage for 0.5 seconds; 
While your armor still up, instead of fully regenerating armor when out of combat, you only regenerate your armor after getting 5 enemy kills; 
When your armor get depleted, It will recover after 2 seconds no matter what the situation; 
After your armor fully regenerated, immune to damage for 1 seconds; 
Killing 10 enemies with akimbo weapon before reloading greant reloading speed and ammo pickup rate boost for 10 seconds, effect halved for non-akimbo weapon. Each enemy you kill resets the duration of the effect to 10 seconds, and klling with headshot during the effect has 50% chance fully regenerate your armor. The effect has a cooldown of 20 seconds.

前总统：将回血阶段提前，现在是护甲开始恢复时恢复血量，而不是恢复满时恢复血量。你收到血量伤害的35%将会作为储存血量，在下一次血量回复时恢复。治疗后溢出的血量的30%将会收回储存血量。在友方单位附近时，你获得的存血量额外增加50%。现在当你的储存血量达到100%时，你可以额外溢出100%。溢出的的部分会随时间失去。收到致命伤害时，会消耗所有血量来抵消这次伤害。每次触发该效果后，需要你存满一次上限来换取下一次触发的机会。
Ex-President: 
Instead requiring your armor being fully up, having any amount of armor will now store health on kill; 
35% of damage taken is converted into stored health; 
30% of health gained from stored health while at maximum health is converted back into stored health; 
+50% health stored from kills when you are close to your crew members; 
Allowing exceeding stored health be temporarily‌ stored (up to 100% of maximum health that can be stored), and gradually lose over time; 
When taking lethal damage, all stored health you currently have will be depleted to prevent taking the damage. This cannot occur more than once untill stored health reaching maximum amount again.

行者：基本继承原版效果。烟雾弹的击杀减少冷却时间增加至2秒，且当你的队友倒地时，会立刻补充一个烟雾弹。当你从烟雾弹范围离开后，烟雾弹效果将会继续生效5秒，生效的时间不会超过烟雾弹的持续时间。神经反射天赋牌的效果现在不会立刻消失，而是在成功闪避后再持续两秒（持续期间不会获得闪避增加）。护甲回复时恢复10%血量。
Sicario: 
Killing enemies now reduce Smoke Bomb's cooldown by 2 second; 
When your teammate getting downed, instantly ends Smoke Bomb's cooldown; 
The smoke screen effect lingers for (up to) 5 seconds after you leave the smoke screen; 
The "Twitch"(3/9) effect remains for 2 seconds before it reset, though getting shot during that will not gain more dodge chance; 
Gain 10% health when your armor replenish.

冰球手：回血机制不变，现在不限制护甲类型。当你的血量为满时，额外的来自天赋的治疗将会增加临时血量上限，最多增加50%，增加速度为恢复速度的50%。身穿西装或轻型防弹背心时，上限为75%，且血量恢复的速度增加30%（实际效果为减少恢复间隔，由0.3秒恢复一次加快到0.21秒）受到致命伤害时，立刻结算所有恢复来抵消这一次伤害，同时会清楚临时血量上限。临时血量上限若在受伤后10秒内没有回满则会清除。
Grinder: 
While at maximum health, healing from your perk deck will increases your maximun health (up to 50% of maximun health) with halved effciency. Your maximun health resets 10 seconds after taking health damage; 
Removing the armor type limit. As compensation, while wearing Suit/LBV healing from your perk deck cash in 30% faster (health every 0.21s) and can gain additional 25% of maximun health; 
When taking lethal damage, all pending healing from your perk deck will be cashed in immediately to try negate getting downed. Also resets your maximun health;
